0b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李公","author":"张嵲","text":"李公白发已如丝，肯惜忠言负主知。\n事大不应回一语，知君不作上官仪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56355,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感","author":"张嵲","text":"倾摧汉祚是安昌，祇恐狂澜世莫当。\n自古忠言宁尽用，老臣得不戒王章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56356,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感二首 其二","author":"张嵲","text":"庾翼神明还旧观，蕺山草树见挥毫。\n如今祗作葡萄用，惆怅遭离老虏曹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56357,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感二首 其一","author":"张嵲","text":"题卷安西嗟妙迹，翩翩遥想翥龙鸾。\n那知偶落黠奴手，只作葡萄一斗看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56358,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵王得之游净明题易安二绝 其二","author":"张嵲","text":"铜驼陌上须臾乐，金穴侯家瞬息欢。\n争似盖头茅一把，老僧终日百般安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56359,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵王得之游净明题易安二绝 其一","author":"张嵲","text":"满院岚光滴翠寒，望湖莫羡十三间。\n门前石上苍苔迹，数得人踪到与还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56360,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵惜春","author":"张嵲","text":"骚人竞赋惜春诗，为惜花飞万点时。\n唯有农家爱春尽，黄云堆麦雪抽丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56361,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江行","author":"张嵲","text":"南讹溽暑方流汗，北陆凄风已裂肤。\n江介寒暄真叵测，袗絺重茧在斯须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56362,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹山道中","author":"张嵲","text":"青山忽断开平陆，鸡犬人烟太古风。\n野老诛茅宁有意，一生身在翠微中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56363,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自礼贤还鹅湖望山顶飞流有作二首 其二","author":"张嵲","text":"夹日赤云方变火，行人渴肺欲生尘。\n飞流百丈垂虹冷，愧尔山中宴坐人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56364,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自礼贤还鹅湖望山顶飞流有作二首 其一","author":"张嵲","text":"农夫秧稻满畦水，行客跨骡无树陂。\n热风吹面日方午，忽见绿岩冰柱垂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56365,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自房州归掌口闻杜鹃时杜鹃花盛开","author":"张嵲","text":"乱中一任青春去，秪有閒愁作鬓华。\n日暮风吹古原树，杜鹃啼遍满林花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56366,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自悼","author":"张嵲","text":"银山卷浪万雷鸣，渚水诸滩险永清。\n平日垂堂犹自戒，年来轻作二江行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56367,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至梅堂次韵","author":"张嵲","text":"牛衣不煖梦初回，声切严城角弄梅。\n旋理敝裘骖蹇足，披霜得个为公来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56368,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中赠鲜于孝叔","author":"张嵲","text":"六年相见倍相亲，欲话离忧恐怆神。\n莫惜维舟连夜语，三巴雅旧更无人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56369,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芍药五首 其五","author":"张嵲","text":"芳气时时侵鼻观，令人三复柳州诗。\n非因寂寞耽幽意，醉倒花间未必知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56370,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芍药五首 其四","author":"张嵲","text":"浅白轻黄皆异态，还如妒宠各低垂。\n暖风一阵涂香烈，午酒醺酣嗅蕊时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56371,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芍药五首 其三","author":"张嵲","text":"典刑虽有但伤心，芳气时来尚满襟。\n还似夏侯家众妓，隔帘聊听绕梁音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56372,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芍药五首 其二","author":"张嵲","text":"凄凄寒雨送馀春，繁艳浓香慰病身。\n忽作暖风迟日想，慨然如在汉江滨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56373,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芍药五首 其一","author":"张嵲","text":"时人惟解爱芳菲，服媚香浓竟莫知。\n幽卧独怜芳气馥，世间惟有柳州诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56374,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观洛神图慨然有作三首 其三","author":"张嵲","text":"轘辕伊阙两相望，草树离离自郁苍。\n旧物祇馀金带枕，夜阑空断九回肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56375,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观洛神图慨然有作三首 其二","author":"张嵲","text":"慇勤遵渚馈明珰，情托微波事渺茫。\n油壁却归天上去，沙晴空见水禽翔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56376,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观洛神图慨然有作三首 其一","author":"张嵲","text":"天边崧少远微茫，犹想霓旌驻水旁。\n逸态瑰姿何处在，尚应遗恨寄君王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56377,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过郧乡寒食日","author":"张嵲","text":"苍茫云树渺相迎，山县烧馀祗故城。\n鸡犬不闻仍禁火，经过转见乱离情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56378,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过覃氏园偶题","author":"张嵲","text":"十日浓阴飞细雨，清川初涨水平沙。\n幽人闭户春已半，开遍山南山北花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56379,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事","author":"张嵲","text":"屐齿休令破紫苔，柴门无客不须开。\n雨馀篱菊埋光去，木落前山献体来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56380,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听微水有感四首 其四","author":"张嵲","text":"袛应初剖判，便有斯江水。\n于今知几时，东流犹瀰瀰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56381,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听微水有感四首 其三","author":"张嵲","text":"西从徼外来，东去还归海。\n徒闻朝暮声，讵识年华改。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56382,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听微水有感四首 其二","author":"张嵲","text":"寒江流不极，叠浪日沄沄。\n讵是悲鸣苦，端由清夜闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":56383,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]